    <h2>If you think in rows, not paragraphs</h2>
    <p>Good fit if you're tracking a budget alongside the schedule, planning a trip with a lot of moving pieces (multi-city, group trip, business travel with expense tracking), or you just prefer data you can sort over a wall of text. If you'd rather write your itinerary out with real context and notes, the <a href="/templates/itinerary-template-google-docs/">Google Docs version</a> is built for that instead.</p>
